          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Excellent experience. The service was polite, pleasant and very friendly, with a desire to serve the customer properly. The quality of the cookies is truly incredible. I took one cookie from each flavor and they were all the same: delicious, crispy and fresh. Honestly, it is difficult to distinguish which was my favorite.",
